    "whatItIs": "Getscreen.me is remote access and screen-sharing software for support and remote work. Free covers 1 user and ≤2 devices. Business plans combine per-user and per-device fees: Standard $5/user + $0.10/device, Advanced $8/user + $0.15/device, Enterprise $10/user + $0.20/device. Personal Lifetime one-time option. 14-day business trial. Adjacent productivity — not a project tracker.",
